  use `$GITHUB_TOKEN` with `curl`, `gh`, or Git over HTTPS. The configured proxy translates that
  placeholder only in scoped `Authorization` headers. GitHub MCP remains appropriate for deliberate
  exceptions such as Actions job logs or separate artifact/blob hosts. Never print or embed the
  placeholder in logs or URLs.
- Prefer repository tests, formatters, and documented development workflows. Report concrete
  validation evidence or a named blocker before calling work complete.

